.TH MENU_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
menu_init \- Reset a Menu: no items, selection 0, position x,y, font (a zero Font uses the debug font), default colors (grey, yellow when selected), line height from the font plus 6, and a 200\-pixel click width
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmenu.h\(dq
.BI "void menu_init(Menu *m, float x, float y, Font font);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reset a Menu: no items, selection 0, position x,y, font (a zero Font uses the debug font), default colors (grey, yellow when selected), line height from the font plus 6, and a 200\-pixel click width. Call in on_enter before menu_add; calling it again rebuilds the menu from scratch, which is how a dynamic menu (a shop whose items depend on GameState) is refreshed.
.SH MODULE
menu (src/engine/menu/menu.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR menu_add (3),
.BR menu_center (3),
.BR Menu (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
